@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M15 — Separate target authority and actual deployment effect
state "Requested exact target\neffect" as Requested
state "Denied / blocked before\naction" as Denied
state "Eligible target action\nunderway" as Acting
state "Intended target effect\nconfirmed" as Succeeded
state "Definite failed outcome" as Failed
state "Confirmed partial effects" as Partial
state "Target effect unknown" as Unknown
[*] --> Requested : scoped initial context
Requested --> Denied : SM-T095 eligibility denied\n[target conditions not met]
Requested --> Acting : SM-T096 target action admitted\n[separate exact target\nauthority]
Acting --> Succeeded : SM-T097 effect confirmed\n[actual required effect]
Acting --> Failed : SM-T098 definite failure\n[definite evidence]
Acting --> Partial : SM-T099 partial effects known\n[bounded partial evidence]
Acting --> Unknown : SM-T100 effect unconfirmed\n[uncertain actual effect]
Unknown --> Succeeded : SM-T101 target reconciled\n[matching effect verified]
Unknown --> Failed : SM-T102 target reconciled\n[definite failed disposition]
Unknown --> Partial : SM-T103 target reconciled\n[partial effects established]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
